' purpose: bounded DEB data-member byte comparison without package installation
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/deb-members.mjs
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/deb-members.test.mjs
' context: _spec/_plans/ml-runtime-redesign.md section 33 owns provenance qualification.
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
left to right direction
title DEB member comparison — authenticated expectations supplied by caller
actor "Caller-provided package/member refs\nprivate package bytes" as CALLER <<host>>
component "compareDebMembers\nstrict snapshot and SHA-256" as PACKAGE <<app>>
component "Three-member AR profile\ncontrol remains inert" as AR <<app>>
component "Node gzip/zstd only\nframing + decoded/window caps" as DECODE <<host>>
component "createTarMemberInventory\nshared validated TAR state machine" as TAR <<app>>
component "Frozen selected-member matches\nno extraction or execution" as RESULT <<app>>
component "DebMemberError\nfixed failure, no partial success" as ERROR <<error>>
CALLER ARROW_MAIN PACKAGE : exact package length/digest before decompression
PACKAGE ARROW_MAIN AR : checked spans, names, sizes and padding
AR ARROW_MAIN DECODE : data.tar.gz or data.tar.zst only
DECODE ARROW_MAIN TAR : bounded decompressed private bytes
TAR ARROW_MAIN RESULT : final regular-file payload spans after valid EOF
RESULT ARROW_MAIN CALLER : exact target path/length/digest comparisons
PACKAGE ARROW_ERROR ERROR : bad expectations, hash or input
AR ARROW_ERROR ERROR : unsupported container/member or malformed framing
DECODE ARROW_ERROR ERROR : malformed/unsupported frame or resource refusal
TAR ARROW_ERROR ERROR : invalid TAR, links as targets or missing member
ERROR ARROW_ERROR CALLER : no fallback decoder or package install
note bottom of AR
Exactly debian-binary / control / data
debian-binary bytes equal '2.0\n'
No extended AR names or extra members
Control scripts never decode or execute
end note
note bottom of DECODE
Input<=8MiB; decoded TAR<=64MiB
One zstd frame; window<=64MiB; no dictionary
Gzip requires reported full input consumption
No data XZ or external decoder fallback
end note
note bottom of RESULT
Targets<=8; JSON<=64KiB; deeply frozen
Signature/provenance/NoPython flags:false
Native/decoder/extraction/runtime flags:false
Caller refs are not authenticated by this module
end note
@enduml
